---
import DefaultPageLayout from "../../layouts/DefaultPageLayout.astro";
import Petapetual from "../../components/Petapetual.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<DefaultPageLayout
    title="For Forgotten Culture"
    description="In the modern world, many traditional rites and practices are starting to be forgotten. If you are unsure as to what traditions you can observe to honour the dearly deceased, Petapetual has got you covered."
>
    <article class="article-container">
        <a href="/examples" class="back-link">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> All Use Cases
        </a>

        <Image
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1641644239376-52e9952a43a6?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1674"
            alt="Over time, culture erodes and traditions slowly become forgotten. Petapetual's value also comes in the form of education: if you don't know what to do to pay respects, we have your back!"
            class="article-hero"
            width="1674"
            height="400"
        />

        <h1 class="article-title">
            <Petapetual /> for those disconnected from their culture
        </h1>

        <p class="article-text">
            As the world becomes more and more modern, many traditional rites
            and practices are slowly being forgotten. If you are someone who
            wants to honour the dearly departed in line with tradition, it can
            be confusing and difficult to know what to do, what prayers to say,
            and what offerings to give (if at all).
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            <Petapetual /> aims to assist you in this aspect. We believe that, <a
                href="/how-it-works"
                class="article-link">amongst other services we provide</a
            >, an online memorial with us is also an opportunity for education.
            We aim to provide you with information, services, and useful
            reminders that are aligned with the traditions you want to observe.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-subtitle">Memorial cultural preferences</h2>

        <p class="article-text">
            By default, all <Petapetual />
            <a class="article-link" href="/how-it-works">memorials</a> are culturally
            and religiously agnostic: we do not make any assumptions or opinionated
            choices as to what and how things should be done. However, if you so
            choose to, you can set a <em>cultural preference</em> for your
            memorial, which will tell us which traditions you want your memorial
            to subscribe to.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            For example, if you set a memorial's cultural preference to <em
                >Buddhist</em
            >, then we will suggest and bias your memorial towards more
            Buddhist <a class="article-link" href="/how-it-works#tributes"
                >tributes</a
            > and <a class="article-link" href="/how-it-works#prayer-streams"
                >prayer streams</a
            >.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            Setting your memorial's cultural preference does not lock you in to
            any one tradition. It only affects service suggestions and special
            date reminders. You can change this setting at any time.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-subtitle">Special date reminders</h2>

        <p class="article-text">
            Your memorials have the ability to send you reminders or information
            about special dates, these include dates such as death
            anniversaries, birthdays, religious festivals, etc.
        </p>

        <div class="article-cta">
            <a href="https://app.petapetual.com" class="cta-btn">
                Create a Memorial <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </article>
</DefaultPageLayout>

<style>
    @reference "tailwindcss";

    .article-container {
        @apply flex flex-col gap-6;
    }

    .back-link {
        @apply text-slate-500 text-sm no-underline;
        @apply hover:text-slate-700 transition-colors;
    }

    .article-hero {
        @apply w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-sm;
        @apply lg:h-72;
    }

    .article-title {
        @apply text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800;
        @apply lg:text-3xl;
    }

    .article-subtitle {
        @apply text-xl font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-2;
    }

    .article-text {
        @apply text-slate-600 leading-relaxed;
    }

    .article-link {
        @apply text-slate-700 underline decoration-slate-300;
        @apply hover:text-slate-900 hover:decoration-slate-500 transition-colors;
    }

    .article-cta {
        @apply mt-4 py-8 text-center;
        @apply border-t border-slate-200;
    }

    .cta-btn {
        @apply inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-slate-600 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold no-underline;
        @apply hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors;
    }
</style>
